sequenceDiagram
    participant Job as "allocationJob: Control"
    participant Run as "allocationRunService: Service"
    participant Planner as "allocationEngine: Service"
    participant ETA as "deliveryEtaService: Service"
    participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
    Job->>Run: startAtPublishedCutoff()
    Run->>+DB: Acquire business-date distributed lock
    Run->>+DB: Snapshot approved orders and shared stock pool
    Run->>+ETA: resolveScheduleDistanceAndEta()
    ETA->>+DB: Read versioned schedule, transit and distance cache
    DB-->>-ETA: ETA inputs snapshot
    ETA-->>-Run: Frozen allocation inputs
    Run->>Planner: planByServerReceivedAtAndOrderCode()
    loop Each order line
        Planner->>Planner: Filter SKU, expiry, availability, radius, ETA and MLOR
        Planner->>Planner: Weighted greedy batch selection
        Planner->>Planner: Calculate post-selection HSD price fragment
    end
    alt All lines complete
        Planner->>DB: Persist proposal, prices and allocation trace
        DB-->>-Run: AwaitingRunApproval
    else Any line short
        Planner->>DB: Persist ShortInRun and rollback tentative draws
        DB-->>-Run: Short result
    end
    Note over Run,DB: Tentative allocation does not change OnHand or Reserved.

